To use this component in a code-native integration without a registry, run
`npm pack` and install the resulting tarball in the integration. The integration
must also depend on `@prismatic-io/spectral`. Import the package's default export
to access its callable actions, triggers, data sources, and connection factories.
Prism publishes missing private component artifacts during integration import.
